@base = http://localhost:4000
# Replace with a real Clerk session token when testing private routes.
@token = REPLACE_WITH_CLERK_SESSION_TOKEN

### Liveness
GET {{base}}/health

### Database readiness
GET {{base}}/ready

### English catalog
GET {{base}}/api/v1/products?locale=en

### Persian product
GET {{base}}/api/v1/products/balancing-toner?locale=fa

### Current account
GET {{base}}/api/v1/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update profile
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"Alex Example"}

### Set quantity (absolute, repeatable)
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/cart/items/01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity":2}

### View cart
GET {{base}}/api/v1/cart?locale=en
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Persist a demo order. Reuse this key only to retry this exact checkout.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6ba7b810-9dad-41d1-80b4-00c04fd430c8

{"shipping":{"name":"Alex Example","email":"alex@example.com","address":"123 Example Street"}}

### Order history
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders?page=1&limit=20&locale=en
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Newsletter opt-in (storage only)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/newsletter
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alex@example.com","locale":"en","consent":true}
